{"version":"2.21","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"B1","layout":"vertical","x":0,"y":0,"fill":"#050607","padding":[56,64,64,64],"gap":36,"name":"board/01 · home","width":"fit_content","height":"fit_content","children":[{"type":"frame","id":"fk4","layout":"vertical","gap":10,"children":[{"type":"text","id":"tjw","content":"01 · HOME","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Mono","fontSize":11,"fill":"#6F767F","letterSpacing":1.6},{"type":"text","id":"tjx","content":"HOME_  Numbered spaces, columns, cards","fontFamily":"Barlow Condensed","fontSize":40,"fill":"#E8E8E3","fontWeight":"600","letterSpacing":0.3},{"type":"text","id":"tjy","content":"The existing Home kept whole: spaces 1–9, a column model with width ranges and seams, AGENTS first, the 36 px parked shell bar, four tabs. Nothing here is a mock dashboard; every panel is a shipped plugin card.","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Sans","fontSize":14,"fill":"#9A9FA6","lineHeight":1.5,"width":1100,"textGrowth":"fixed-width"},{"type":"frame","id":"fk2","layout":"vertical","gap":6,"padding":[10,14],"stroke":"#D9A93A","strokeWidth":{"left":2},"w":1100,"children":[{"type":"text","id":"tjz","content":"NEW THIS ROUND","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Mono","fontSize":10,"fill":"#D9A93A","fontWeight":"700","letterSpacing":1.4},{"type":"text","id":"tk0","content":"· Spaces on this board are the shipped model. Board 08 replaces them: workspaces get their own page and Home keeps a strip into it.","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Sans","fontSize":13,"fill":"#D9A93A","lineHeight":1.45,"width":1080,"textGrowth":"fixed-width"},{"type":"text","id":"tk1","content":"· App-wide capture removed from every screen.","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Sans","fontSize":13,"fill":"#D9A93A","lineHeight":1.45,"width":1080,"textGrowth":"fixed-width"}]},{"type":"text","id":"tk3","content":"Restyled in signal orange with SLAB glyphs and the HOME · MACHINES · PLUGINS nav, all proposed. SHIPPED / EXTENDS / PROPOSED tags describe behaviour, not this look.","fontFamily":"IBM Plex Mono","fontSize":11,"fill